I noticed the only way to kick in the Mac version of Nethack seems to be
with the menu option (there's no keyboard character).  On the VMS
version, since the keypad option is turned on, I can use the 'k' key. 
Even though the Mac version seems to use the keypad (IIcx with standard
keyboard), I can't use the 'k' key to kick... very annoying.  Perhaps
this can be fixed when the next Mac version is built.  Thanks!

